  "notes": {
    "tbb": "The tbb wheel ships only shared libraries (libtbb.so and friends under .data/data/lib) and provides no importable Python module -- verified against tbb-2021.13.1. numba consumes it through the native threading layer, not through an import. The empty list means 'this distribution is deliberately not import-verifiable', not 'not yet mapped': mapping it to ['tbb'] made verify_extra_profile fail the whole numba profile on every platform where the wheel actually installs."
